      "title": "⓪ 缺模型？/ Missing models?",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n全新安裝沒有模型檔，這支「首尾幀生影片」範本需要以下 6 個檔案（與「參考圖生影片」完全相同，裝過那支就不用再抓）：\n\n- `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` → 19.53 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- `qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` → 14.61 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/sakamakismile/Qwen3-VL-32B-Heretic-MiniMax-H3-NVFP4/resolve/main/qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/vae/` → 4.85 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/vae/` → 0.56 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/loras/` → 0.91 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/drbaph/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-ComfyUI/resolve/main/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n- `qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` → 8.27 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/resolve/main/qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors\n  （「想法 → 英文提示詞」小幫手用的無審查編碼器，和其他想法範本共用；平台目前沒有這顆的備份鏡像，請走官方載點。）\n\n共約 48.7 GB。放好檔案後**不用重啟 ComfyUI 或 worker**：ComfyFed agent 每 10 分鐘自動重掃模型庫存並回報平台，評估會自動轉綠；急著馬上生效的話，手動重啟 agent 即可。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nA fresh install has none of these files. The first+last-frame template needs 6 files — exactly the reference-to-video template's stack, so if you installed that one there is nothing new to download:\n\n- `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` -> 19.53 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- `qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` -> 14.61 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/sakamakismile/Qwen3-VL-32B-Heretic-MiniMax-H3-NVFP4/resolve/main/qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/vae/` -> 4.85 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/vae/` -> 0.56 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/loras/` -> 0.91 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/drbaph/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-ComfyUI/resolve/main/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n- `qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` -> 8.27 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/resolve/main/qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors\n  (The uncensored prompt-helper encoder, shared with every other idea-box template. No ComfyFed mirror yet, use the official link.)\n\nAbout 48.7 GB in total. After placing the files there is **no need to restart ComfyUI or the worker** — the agent rescans its model inventory every 10 minutes; restart the agent manually to pick it up right away."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
