      "title": "① 用途＋紅框 / Purpose + red-framed nodes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 只改這一區（三顆紅框）**\n\n給一張「開頭長怎樣」的圖、一張「結尾長怎樣」的圖，H3 會自己生出中間的動作與聲音。\n\n- 兩顆 `LoadImage`：首幀與尾幀，換成你自己的圖（直接在節點上傳即可）。\n- 紅框「想法」節點：用**中文**描述首尾之間發生什麼（動作、鏡頭、聲音）。本機的 Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic（無審查版）會寫成英文提示詞、自動補上 `<Picture 1>` 標記再接進生成節點——露骨的想法也照寫，不會被拒絕。AI 寫出的英文會顯示在預覽節點。\n- 想自己直接寫英文提示詞：把生成節點的 `prompt` 輸入線拔掉，欄位就會變回可以手打。\n\n預設首尾幀都是同一張範例圖（所以預設跑出來是「幾乎不動」的影片）——先換圖再跑。\n\n---\n\n**English — only edit this box (the three red nodes)**\n\nTwo `LoadImage` nodes take the first and last frame; the red idea node takes a **Chinese** (or English) description of what happens in between — motion, camera, audio. The local, uncensored Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic model writes the English prompt, prepends the `<Picture 1>` tag and wires it into the generation node; the English it wrote shows in the preview node. To write the prompt yourself, unplug the generation node's `prompt` input. The template ships with the same sample image as both frames, so swap them before running."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        900,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        900,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 21,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "② 這在做什麼 / What this does",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` 用首幀圖當身分參考、也當影片的第一格；\n它輸出的 `positive`（提示詞條件）和 `LATENT`（影片畫布）先送進\n`MiniMaxH3AddGuide`，這顆節點把「尾幀」圖錨定在 `frame_idx = -1`\n（負數＝從影片結尾算，`-1` 就是最後一格），輸出更新過的 `positive`\n再接到 `BasicGuider`。\n\n換句話說：`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` 定頭，`MiniMaxH3AddGuide` 定尾，\n兩者中間的畫面由模型自己補上，這就是「首尾幀生影片」的核心機制。\n\n後面的取樣參數（`steps=8`、`res_multistep`＋`simple`）跟參考圖生影片範本\n完全一樣，是配合 turbo LoRA 的固定搭配，新手不用動。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` uses the first-frame image as both the identity\nreference and frame 0 of the video. Its `positive` conditioning and `LATENT`\ncanvas feed into `MiniMaxH3AddGuide`, which anchors the last-frame image at\n`frame_idx = -1` (negative indices count from the end, so -1 is the final\nframe) and outputs an updated `positive` that then goes to `BasicGuider`.\nEverything in between the two anchors is generated by the model — that is\nthe whole first/last-frame mechanism. The sampler settings are identical to\nthe reference-to-video template's turbo-LoRA pairing; leave them alone."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1820,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        700,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 22,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "③ 結果在哪 / Where the result is",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 輸出在哪裡看**\n\nH3 一次生出畫面和聲音兩軌，`VAEDecode` 還原畫面、`VAEDecodeAudio` 還原聲音，\n`CreateVideo` 把兩軌合成一支影片（24 fps），`SaveVideo` 存成 mp4 / h264。\n\n按右上角 Run 之後這會變成一個聯邦 job；完成後影片直接在 `SaveVideo`\n節點裡播放，Console 的「工作」頁面也拿得到檔案和收據。\n\n---\n\n**English — where the result shows up**\n\nH3 produces video and audio together; `VAEDecode` and `VAEDecodeAudio`\ndecode each track, `CreateVideo` muxes them at 24 fps, and `SaveVideo`\nwrites an h264 mp4. After Run this becomes a federation job; the clip plays\ninside `SaveVideo` and is also downloadable from the console's Jobs page."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
